    "updated_at": "2025-05-20T12:24:42Z",
    "body": "The initial step towards this involves these Fetch and HTML PRs:\n\n- https://github.com/whatwg/fetch/pull/1807\n- https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/10990\n- https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/11133\n- https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/10991\n\n@bvandersloot-mozilla I have now taken a look at all of these, pushed some fixes, and they look good from my perspective, but OP still needs to be updated in most to reflect multi-implementer interest and the testing situation. Could you take care of that?\n\nAnd as https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/10990#issuecomment-2709434668 reminded me there might also be need for a Storage Access API PR to account for some logic no longer having to be maintained there?\n\n@domenic would you be willing to also review the HTML PRs as they impact navigation to some extent?",
