    "body": "These two PRs are still outstanding at this point:\n\n- [ ] https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/11540\n   - [ ] This still needs tests.\n- [ ] https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/10990\n   - [ ] But this needs a corresponding Storage Access API PR and Fetch PR.\n   - [ ] We also need to move the field to policy container as suggested by Domenic.\n   - [ ] We should rename to \"is eligible for storage access\" as actually having storage access depends on that and other things, such as the permission or being same origin with the top-level origin.\n\n- [ ] We also need to specify unpartitioned cookie access in layered-cookies (https://github.com/httpwg/http-extensions/issues/3325)\n\nBeyond that, we need a plan for the remainder of https://privacycg.github.io/storage-access/.",
